# Qualibur

Qualibur is a fast, hackable, no nonsene CMS and page builder.

All paths get routed to the same page
the client fetches components based on url path
this way fast, client side routing can be achieved
no server side routing
no server side rendering
yes static site generation

a builder that compiles a graphically built page to JSX
JSX can then be added as custom component and manually edited if needed

- external oauth provide
- stable REST specification for server
- default server uses nosql, but can be swapped with other implementations
